      "Uniswap V3/V4 LP positions used as collateral (Arcadia accounts, Gage vaults and loan accounts hold position NFTs): the stock inside sits in the pool, not in the lender, so balanceOf does not see it and pool depth already includes it. Liquidating such a position withdraws that liquidity. DefiLlama unwraps these, which is why its Arcadia and Gage stock figures are higher.",
      "Zona, Oter Finance, Kyros Finance: lending protocols listed on DefiLlama for Robinhood Chain whose adapter source is not public; no contract addresses found. DefiLlama showed under $30 of these stocks across all three on Sep 27, 2026.",
